{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ones Beyond</strong> is a first-person psychological horror experience set deep within a dark, isolated forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young woman goes camping to clear her mind \u2014 but when night falls, she awakens in the middle of the forest, alone and disoriented. Her camp is gone. The silence is haunting. And she soon realizes something sinister is happening in the woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surrounded by cultists performing dark rituals, she must find a way to escape before the night consumes her. Every step brings her closer to the horrifying truth behind <i>The Ones Beyond</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130150/extras/6aa6fb5d08a5bb17e11d04965191278c.poster.avif?t=1762424871\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130150/extras/6aa6fb5d08a5bb17e11d04965191278c.webm?t=1762424871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130150/extras/6aa6fb5d08a5bb17e11d04965191278c.mp4?t=1762424871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 <strong>Realistic Environment:</strong> Foggy woods, abandoned structures, and an unsettling atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd26 <strong>Survival Elements:</strong> Manage your flashlight batteries, light, and time carefully.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfac <strong>Cinematic Experience:</strong> Deep storytelling, immersive sound design, and visual depth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78 <strong>Psychological Horror:</strong> What you don\u2019t see is far more dangerous than what you do.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <strong>Cult-Driven Mystery:</strong> Strange rituals, eerie symbols, and whispers from the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130150/extras/0c3eebed25ffd7b00186f748fe81c15f.poster.avif?t=1762424871\" width=450 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130150/extras/0c3eebed25ffd7b00186f748fe81c15f.webm?t=1762424871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130150/extras/64ce5e5131ab0038ff3747156945eac8.poster.avif?t=1762424871\" width=450 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130150/extras/64ce5e5131ab0038ff3747156945eac8.webm?t=1762424871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4130150?t=1762424871","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4130150?t=1762424871","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130150/d4fb12abb51b284c9d6e96d638bb210ca25753f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762424871","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130150/d4fb12abb51b284c9d6e96d638bb210ca25753f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762424871","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ones Beyond</strong> is a first-person psychological